# docs/rulebook.md was ignored here until 2026-09-04, on the grounds that it was
# a working document and "not the app". It is the app now: src/lib/rulebook.js
# imports it and /rules renders it, so a checkout without it cannot build. It is
# tracked, and this line is kept as the note of why it stopped being ignored.

